there is a very simple solution to this...
don't do it.  don't accept every little toy that the game
gives you.  Try to win with self set rules, like say
I will not use any wishes in this game or
I will not utilize wraith corpses/potions of gain level
etc, etc

for those of you who despise overly generous games,
just use a little self-discipline to resist the temptation
of using this wealth of trinkets.  Any person can play
the game any way he/she wishes, even to not use wishes.

now, back to my Gehennom entering 15th level, 100 hp, AC -7 never
gotten a wish(even from the castle), archeologist(sp?)...
And if I die, so be it. 

this post is not lambasting those of you that wish to use
every thing the game gives you, it is only suggesting
some options to make the game more challenging if you
decide you want to have a more challenging game.
quit b*tching about how easy the game is.  The game
is what you make it, not what it makes you.

But by all means, play the game as *you* wish to play it,
not as someone tells you you should play it
That is what is so great about nethack, it is a very personal
game.  Every game is individual to the person playing.

